00","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1987,"end":2001,"desc":"En los noventa el estilo brutal de Nine Inch Nails lo invade todo en EE UU y el industrial se vuelve fenómeno de masas; el «aggro» de KMFDM es menos visible pero igual de ubicuo: Grotus, Filter, Stabbing Westward, Acumen, Skrew, Electric Hellfire Club, Society Burning, Gravity Kills y, lo más original, Girls Vs Boys (Venus Luxure No.1 Baby) y New Wet Kojak. La EBM internacional se vuelve más brutal (Leaether Strip, Suicide Commando, :Wumpscut:, Hocico, Mentallo & The Fixer). La «música de la fábrica de la muerte» sobrevive en los escultores de ruido: los neozelandeses Dead C (Harsh '70s Reality, «música imposible de escuchar»), Gate, Bruce Russell, Namanax, Illusion Of Safety, Maeror Tri, Towering Inferno (Kaddish). Y el «digital hardcore» de Atari Teenage Riot y Alec Empire.","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Gótico e industrial","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial-90s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":154509667753964,"artist":"Gate","artist_id":36672121067689,"title":"Dew Line","year":1994,"ess":0,"yt":"rkYWRZ-5-qc","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"La segunda venida del industrial","scene_id":69660706111119,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.7"],"pages":[[1,256,null]]},{"id":41457811337812,"artist":"Gate","artist_id":36672121067689,"title":"The Lavender Head","year":1998,"ess":0,"yt":"ZYXFzeLh5ww","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"La segunda venida del industrial","scene_id":69660706111119,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.7"],"pages":[[1,257,null]]}],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":204158240165381,"type":"al